{"PageNumber":349,"Verses":[{"SurahNumber":23,"SurahIndex":"023","VerseNumber":105,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"أَلَمۡ تَكُنۡ ءَايَٰتِي تُتۡلَىٰ عَلَيۡكُمۡ فَكُنتُم بِهَا تُكَذِّبُونَ","TajweedText":"أَلَمْ تَكُنْ ءَايَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>تِى تُتْلَىٰ عَلَيْكُمْ فَكُ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نت</tajweed><tajweed class=ikhafa_shafawi>ُم ب</tajweed>ِهَا تُكَذِّب<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>١٠٥</span>","End":"١٠٥","PageNumber":349,"JuzNumber":18,"ManzilNumber":4,"RukuNumber":300,"MaqraNumber":139,"HizbNumber":35,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":23,"SurahIndex":"023","VerseNumber":106,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"قَالُواْ رَبَّنَا غَلَبَتۡ عَلَيۡنَا شِقۡوَتُنَا وَكُنَّا قَوۡمٗا ضَآلِّينَ","TajweedText":"قَالُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> رَبَّنَا غَلَبَتْ عَلَيْنَا شِ<tajweed class=qalaqah>قْ</tajweed>وَتُنَا وَكُ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َا قَوْ<tajweed class=ikhafa>مًا ض</tajweed><tajweed class=madda_necessary>َا</tajweed>ٓلّ<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>١٠٦</span>","End":"١٠٦","PageNumber":349,"JuzNumber":18,"ManzilNumber":4,"RukuNumber":300,"MaqraNumber":139,"HizbNumber":35,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":23,"SurahIndex":"023","VerseNumber":107,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"رَبَّنَآ أَخۡرِجۡنَا مِنۡهَا فَإِنۡ عُدۡنَا فَإِنَّا ظَٰلِمُونَ","TajweedText":"رَبَّن<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َآ</tajweed> أَخْرِ<tajweed class=qalaqah>جْ</tajweed>نَا مِنْهَا فَإِنْ عُ<tajweed class=qalaqah>دْ</tajweed>نَا فَإِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َا ظَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>لِم<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>١٠٧</span>","End":"١٠٧","PageNumber":349,"JuzNumber":18,"ManzilNumber":4,"RukuNumber":300,"MaqraNumber":139,"HizbNumber":35,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":23,"SurahIndex":"023","VerseNumber":108,"Sh